---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const repo = "https://github.com/PureMunky/no-scroll-recipes";
---
<Base title="Submit a recipe" description="Share a recipe with No Scroll Recipes.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Submit a recipe</h1>
    <p>Got a dish worth sharing? Submissions are reviewed before they go live, and every recipe follows the same no-fluff format: ingredients, steps, and one optional tip.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-accent" href={`${repo}/issues/new?template=recipe.yml`}>Submit a recipe on GitHub</a></p>
    <h2>The ground rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Write it in your own words. Don't copy steps from a cookbook or another site.</li>
      <li>Ingredients with real amounts, steps in order, and safe cooking temperatures for meat, fish and eggs.</li>
      <li>By submitting, you agree we can publish your recipe on this site with credit to you.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted">A GitHub account is needed for now. A no-account form is on the way.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose{max-width:640px;padding:10px 0 30px}
  h1{font-size:clamp(26px,4.5vw,36px);margin:28px 0 8px}
  h2{font-size:21px;margin-top:28px}
  li{margin:6px 0}
  .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
</style>
